Projetc Aether AOSP
===========

Getting started
---------------

To get started with Android/AetherAOSP, you'll need to get familiar with [Source Control Tools](https://source.android.com/setup/develop).

To initialize your local repository using the LineageOS trees, use a command like this:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/Project-Aether-AOSP/android.git -b lineage-23.2 --git-lfs
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync
```
Building
=========
Prepare the terminal for building.
```
.build/envsetup.sh
```
Upnext, Lunch your device
```
lunch lineage_$device-bp4a-userdebug
```
Then, start the building process
```
mka bacon
```
Alternatively, you can just brunch the device
```
brunch $device
```
